<h1>trailmap</h1>
<p class="muted">The task domain, served by trails — RFCs, stories and the
ready queue, read and written in one place.</p>

<h2>Pages</h2>
<div class="box">
  <div class="box-row"><a href="/rfcs">RFCs</a> — every RFC and its stories.</div>
  <div class="box-row"><a href="/backlog">Backlog</a> — the ready queue, in rank order.</div>
  <div class="box-row"><a href="/dashboard">Fleet</a> — open PRs, panes, spawns and CI, live from ringo.</div>
</div>

<h2>Owners</h2>
<p class="muted">The same work, the GitHub way: an owner, its repositories, and
code, issues, pull requests, actions, projects, wiki, insights and settings
under each one.</p>
<div class="box">
  <% if (owners.length === 0) { %>
    <div class="empty">No owner is configured. <code>pnpm db:seed</code> writes them.</div>
  <% } %>
  <% for (const owner of owners) { %>
    <div class="box-row"><a href="/<%= owner.login %>"><%= owner.login %></a>
      <% if (owner.display_name) { %> — <%= owner.display_name %><% } %></div>
  <% } %>
</div>

<h2>Status vocabulary</h2>
<p class="muted">Story statuses, then the RFC statuses that gate them.</p>
<p>
  <%= render({ partial: "shared/status-badge", locals: { status: "draft" } }) %>
  <%= render({ partial: "shared/status-badge", locals: { status: "ready" } }) %>
  <%= render({ partial: "shared/status-badge", locals: { status: "claimed" } }) %>
  <%= render({ partial: "shared/status-badge", locals: { status: "in-progress" } }) %>
  <%= render({ partial: "shared/status-badge", locals: { status: "blocked" } }) %>
  <%= render({ partial: "shared/status-badge", locals: { status: "done" } }) %>
  <%= render({ partial: "shared/status-badge", locals: { status: "closed" } }) %>
</p>
<p>
  <%= render({ partial: "shared/status-badge", locals: { status: "active" } }) %>
  <%= render({ partial: "shared/status-badge", locals: { status: null } }) %>
</p>
